     "p": {
      "ar": "**vectorization**: عمليات على العمود كله مرة واحدة (`df[\"a\"] * df[\"b\"]`) أسرع جدًا من `apply` أو loop على الصفوف. `apply` بيشغّل بايثون لكل صف. وللشروط: `np.where` أو `.where` بدل apply.",
      "en": "**Vectorisation**: operations on a whole column at once (`df[\"a\"] * df[\"b\"]`) are far faster than `apply` or a loop over rows. `apply` runs Python per row. For conditions: `np.where` or `.where` instead of apply."
     },
     "ex": "import pandas as pd, numpy as np, time\ndf = pd.DataFrame({\"qty\": np.random.default_rng(1).integers(1, 10, 50_000), \"price\": 50})\nt = time.perf_counter(); a = df.apply(lambda r: r.qty * r.price, axis=1); t1 = time.perf_counter() - t\nt = time.perf_counter(); b = df[\"qty\"] * df[\"price\"]; t2 = time.perf_counter() - t\nprint(f\"apply {t1:.3f}s vs vectorised {t2:.4f}s — same result: {a.equals(b)}\")\ndf[\"size\"] = np.where(b > 300, \"big\", \"small\")\nprint(df[\"size\"].value_counts().to_dict())",
     "run": 1
